\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Efficiency--adaptability tradeoff for ParetoBandit ($K{=}3$, PCA-25). Each point is one ($\alpha $, $n_\mathit  {eff}$, $\gamma $) configuration; colour encodes $\gamma $. The green band marks the $\epsilon $-feasible region ($\geq $99.75\% of best AUC); 98 of 144 configurations pass. The black star is the $\epsilon $-constraint winner; the red \textbf  {X} is the AUC-only winner ($\gamma {=}1.0$), which suffers the highest Phase-2 regret.}}{17}{figure.caption.44}\protected@file@percent }
